for this year at  least  well we're bringing in the quarantine  policy again because as the number of  new infections comes down so the  proportion of infections that come from  abroad increases simply because the  number of infections new infections  domestically it is coming right down you  know I've said before I really hope that  we're going people are going to be able  to fly to go on summer holiday but we've  got to we've got to take a an approach  that starts with caution of course we do  okay Matthew Hancock thank you very much  for being on the program this morning  thank you
 

